Z||000005||AkursedX||03-28-2001||03:34 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fierobob88:<BR><B>Hi, I am looking for a set of lowering springs.  The only thing I have found are eibach's 1" drop, from the fierostore.  Can anyone please tell me some other choices?  Thanks!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Hello, and welcome to the forum.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  If you have an '88 Fiero (as I am assuming by the "88" in your name)  your spring choices are somewhat limited.  Most places only have springs for 84-87 Fiero's.  And '88's are different I guess.  <BR>I ordered the lowering springs from the Fiero Store and I am expecting to have them on this weekend.  Hopefully they will give it a nice drop.  (I must say that I'm kinda worried though, I have heard good and bad reviews on them, but hopefully they will work)  <BR>As for any other place that have lowering springs for the '88...I have no idea if there is anyone else.<P><BR>||||reg||1
